<p id="mwhw">32 potential contestants were revealed on September 23, 2022.<sup about="#mwt64" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-19" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-19"}}'><a href="#cite_note-19" id="mwiA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwiQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwig">[</span>19<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwiw">]</span></span></a></sup></p> 

<p id="mwjA">The final cast of 30 women was announced on January 4, 2023.<sup about="#mwt67" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-20" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-20"}}'><a href="#cite_note-20" id="mwjQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwjg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwjw">[</span>20<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwkA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

