<p id="mwAns">Charity participated in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_season_32)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American season 32)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAnw">season 32</a> of <i id="mwAn0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dancing_with_the_Stars_(American_TV_series)" title="Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)" id="mwAn4">Dancing with the Stars</a></i> where she partnered with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artem_Chigvintsev" title="Artem Chigvintsev" id="mwAn8">Artem Chigvintsev</a>.<sup about="#mwt201" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-58" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-58"}}'><a href="#cite_note-58" id="mwAoA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAoE"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoI">[</span>57<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAoM">]</span></span></a></sup> They finished in fourth place.</p>

